Clinical content attribution
------------------------------------------------------------------------------
The adult triage thresholds and discriminators implemented in
`src/triageflow/core/sats_rules.py` and summarised in `protocols/sats_adult.md`
are a fact-based re-encoding of the South African Triage Scale (SATS), Adult
pathway, from:

    SATS Training Manual 2012
    South African Triage Group (SATG) / Emergency Medicine Society of South
    Africa (EMSSA), with the Western Cape Government: Health.

SATS materials are published under Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial-
ShareAlike 3.0 (CC BY-NC-SA 3.0). This project redistributes only a re-encoded
rule table (clinical facts and thresholds) with attribution; it does NOT
redistribute the SATS charts, posters, or manual text. Credit: South African
Triage Group, SATS Training Manual 2012.

This software is NOT a medical device and NOT affiliated with or endorsed by
SATG / EMSSA. The thresholds must be clinically reviewed before any real use.

